    <h1>About</h1>
        <p>Inner Flowing is my teaching home, reaching students worldwide through live online teaching. Qigong is the heart of the work. I travel frequently to give lectures and to collaborate on projects such as Qigong, Yoga, Therapeutic Bodywork and Meditation retreats, which is why my regular teaching takes place online.</p>
